We first draw a diagram: [asy]
pair A, B, C, D, E;
A = (0, 30);
B = (-12, 0);
C = (12, 0);
D = 0.5 * B + 0.5 * C;
E = 0.5 * A + 0.5 * C;
draw(A--B--C--cycle);
draw(A--D);
draw(D--E);
draw(D+(-1, 0)--D+(-1, 1)--D+(0, 1));
label("$A$", A, N);
label("$B$", B, SW);
label("$C$", C, SE);
label("$D$", D, S);
label("$E$", E, NE);
